<item>
  <title>ECT Euromax terminal beperkt open vanaf dinsdag 20 januari 09:00 uur </title>
  <link>https://www.ect.nl/nl/nieuws/dossiers/n4-euromax/ect-euromax-terminal-beperkt-open-vanaf-dinsdag-20-januari-0900-uur</link>
  <description>  &lt;div class="layout layout--onecol"&gt;
    &lt;div class="layout__region layout__region--content"&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="field field--name-node-post-date field--type-ds field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;20 January 2026 - 06:46&lt;/div&gt;
      
            &lt;div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"&gt;&lt;p&gt;As previously announced, the migration from our current Terminal Operating System (TOS) to a new, up‑to‑date TOS started this past weekend at the ECT Euromax terminal. As of tomorrow, Tuesday 20 January at 09:00 hrs, the terminal will reopen for road transport. Please note: we will begin operating via the D‑route and will call up only a very limited number of drivers per hour. During the first days, our target is 100 trips per day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Information about the migration can be found on our website, where we have opened a dedicated page at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://www.ect.nl/en/tos-euromax"&gt;https://www.ect.nl/en/tos-euromax&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For questions, you can also contact the Customer Service Desk at +31(0)181 278088 or &lt;a href="mailto:customerservice@ect.nl"&gt;customerservice@ect.nl&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ECT is not responsible for the timely transmission of this message.&lt;/p&gt;
